<h3 id="portfolio">Used Cars (Portfolio)</h3>
<p>Install and activate <b>Portfolio Post Type</b> from <b>Appearance &gt; Install Plugins</b>. Add items in the Portfolio menu and fill in the <b>Project details and gallery</b> fields in each item's editor. These fields require Advanced Custom Fields and its Repeater add-on.</p>
<p>Add the <b>Portfolio Grid</b> widget to a page using SiteOrigin Page Builder to display your items. In <b>Appearance &gt; Customize &gt; [PT] Theme Options &gt; Portfolio</b>, select the parent page and configure the URL slug and gallery columns. This section appears when Portfolio Post Type is active.</p>
